bp3 q - quest/exp state. Doors:
bp3 q c|r|d ...              quest door (create, read, delete)
bp3 q <quest> c|r|u|d ...    exp door for one quest
bp3 q <quest> diagram ...    generated graph diagram from the live rollup (mvp.4)
bp3 q icebox r [term...]     search frozen icebox entries (read-only)
bp3 e [<edge> ...]           claimed edge door: resolved context, no names typed (mvp.2)
bp3 harness desk <verb> ...  desks (machine-local); bp3 worktree is its documented alias
bp3 config [--source]        view the machine-local config store (<git-common-dir>/bp3/)
bp3 q hooks                  harness hook emitter (fail-open)
Run bp3 q <door> -h for that door's verbs, edges, and flags.
bp3 q <quest> u <exp> <edge> - edges and their flags:
edges: handoff grade verify land block resume
handoff --commit <sha> --reason <why>    bind a clean commit for grade
grade  --verdict ship|needs_fix --reason <why>
verify --verdict pass|fail --reason <why>
land   --reason <why>                    land an approved exp
block  --reason <why>                    park for a human decision
resume --reason <why>                    human only: unblock
Shared flags: --format json|table|tree, --target <name>.
Example: bp3 q my-quest u exp-1 handoff --commit abc123 --reason "ready"
